  "summary": "I’m a full-stack engineer with 3 years of experience building impactful, scalable web applications. After graduating from App Academy, where I honed my skills in full-stack development, I’ve worked on a diverse range of projects, specializing in both front-end and back-end technologies.\n\nMy technical toolkit has evolved to include a strong proficiency in JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Next.js, Node.js, Express, and Python, along with expertise in working with headless CMS technologies, PostgreSQL, and web hosting platforms like Netlify and Heroku. I’ve also gained hands-on experience with AWS, particularly in routing and cloud infrastructure management.\n\nI’m passionate about solving problems with creative solutions and bringing user-centric designs to life. I’m always excited to learn new technologies and push the boundaries of what’s possible in the development world.\n\nLet’s connect! Feel free to reach out.\n\nbrandonflores647@gmail.com",
